s with access to documentation, guides, and community-led resources for quantum machine learning, quantum chemistry simulations, and other quantum computing applications, along with collaboration and support from a team of quantum experts. The company serves professional clients in the quantum computing, software development, and machine learning sectors, as well as advanced users in research and development, including those utilizing high-performance computing and quantum hardware. Xanadu Quantum Technologies Limited was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Toronto, Canada."}}